# The brand SSOT (@myavenceo/aven-ceo) lives in GitHub Packages, whose npm
# registry needs a token even for a public package.
#
# Only the REGISTRY is pinned here. The token deliberately is not: writing
# `_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}` would look tidier, but a project .npmrc
# outranks ~/.npmrc, so on any machine without that variable the empty value
# would override a developer's real login and 401 every install. CI supplies
# the token instead (see .github/actions/bun-install), and developers fall
# through to their own ~/.npmrc.
@myavenceo:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
